## Cardinality — object

Constrains the number of instances of an object type at any time.

**ORM 2 graphical signal:** `# = N`, `# ≤ N`, etc. adjacent to the object type.

**YAML form (top-level):**
```yaml
constraints:
  - type: cardinality
    scope: object
    object_type: <ot_id>
    bound: { min: 1, max: 1 }
    source: …
    status: …
    modality: …
```

